  "notes": "Maqam Rast scale in 24-EDO: C D E-half-flat F G A B-half-flat. Equal-tempered reference. || Cent values after Sami Abu Shumays' maqam presets for Ableton Live 12 (tuning.ableton.com/arabic-maqam). Egypt/Greater Syria practice, one practitioner's deeply-informed version -- NOT a universal standard. Maqam identity is melodic, not just the scale."
